# MONOS — Dialog Tier Golden Reference (FROZEN)

**Status:** Visual design **approved** and **frozen** (Jul 2026).

**Golden reference:** `scripts/test_dialog_tiers.py` (harness) + `monostudio/ui_qt/dialog_tier/` (implementation).

**Do not** redesign, “improve”, or tweak layout, spacing, typography, radius, colors, hierarchy, or visual language unless a **real production bug** is found.

---

## Allowed changes only

- Bugs · accessibility · DPI · keyboard navigation · performance · maintainability · code quality · design-system consistency

**Never** visual changes for personal preference.

