## Key tokens (do not drift)

- **Spacing:** `chrome_pad_x` 32 · `form_spacing_y` 24 · `field_label_gap` 8 · footer pad bottom 24
- **Radius:** `radius_l1` / `radius_l2` 16 · `radius_sm` 8
- **Shadow:** 3 layers — ambient (0,12) blur 48 @ 0.10 · middle (0,4) blur 20 @ 0.08 · contact (0,1) blur 4 @ 0.06
- **Border:** rim overlay > shadow visually; `border_idle_a` / `border_hover_a` on chroma
- **Focus:** `focus_blue_a` · shell owns stroke (not inner `QLineEdit` border)

---

## Production review (baseline)

| Area | Status | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Initial focus | OK | Demos focus first editable field + L1 select-all |
| Tab order | Default Qt | No custom `setTabOrder` — verify when porting to production |
| Esc / dismiss | Partial | Close × + Cancel; confirm `MonosDialog` Esc policy per flow |
| DPI | OK | Device-pixel snap, shadow pixmap cache, Round scale policy |
| Repaint | Note | L1 sidebar nebula timer repaints dialog — acceptable for harness |
| Long text | OK | `wordWrap` on subtitles; `_ElidedPathLabel` on paths |
| Localization | Gap | English hardcoded — use `tr()` when shipping |
| Resize | Fixed size | Intentional for tier shells |
| A11y | Gap | Icon-only controls need `setAccessibleName` / descriptions in production |
| Keyboard | Gap | CTA default button + Enter accept not wired in harness |

**When porting:** fix gaps above without changing golden visuals.

---

## Reviewing new dialogs

1. Read `rule_dialog_design_system_v1.mdc` — never invent visual style.
2. Read `plan_dialog_content_flow_v1.mdc` — Hero → Input → Result → Explain → Action.
3. Use `Tier1Dialog` or `Tier2Dialog` + components from `dialog_tier`.
3. Compare spacing, field shells, footer, shadow, typography against harness demos.
4. **Do not** change the golden reference to match a new dialog — raise the new dialog to this bar.

---

